{"post_id":15,"title":"The Makers","slug":"the-makers","status":"publish","elementor_data":[{"id":"a37d2ce","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"boxed","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"88","right":"64","bottom":"56","left":"64","isLinked":false},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":24,"column":"24","row":"24","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"fa446a0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>THE MAKERS</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":13},"typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":0.18}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"9ba6dd1","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"The people whose hands you are buying","header_size":"h1","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":60},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.035},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.06}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"2a606c0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Most shops show you a product against a white background and hope you do not ask where it came from. We do the opposite. Before a piece goes on sale here, we go to the place it is made, and we film it.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":20},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.6}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"1d9dfbf","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"boxed","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"64","bottom":"72","left":"64","isLinked":false},"background_background":"classic","flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"5a71ac7","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"boxed","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#F1F1F3","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"20","bottom":"20","left":"20","isLinked":true},"min_height":{"unit":"px","size":440},"flex_justify_content":"center","flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"321b617","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>WORKSHOP PHOTOGRAPH</p>","text_color":"#6E6E73","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":12},"typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":0.18}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":false},{"id":"0d492d9","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"boxed","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"64","bottom":"88","left":"64","isLinked":false},"flex_direction":"row","gap":{"unit":"px","size":48,"column":"48","row":"48","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"613976b","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"full","gap":{"unit":"px","size":12,"column":"12","row":"12","isLinked":true},"width":{"size":50,"unit":"%"},"flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"f1085be","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Why we film","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":30},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"94cd71d","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>A photograph tells you what a thing looks like. A film tells you how long it took, how it sounds when it is being made, and what the person making it was thinking about. That is the part that decides whether you keep something for a decade or replace it next year.</p><p>Every film is two or three minutes. No voiceover, no music swelling at the end. Just the bench, the tools and the work.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.7}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"d2d2f3e","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"full","gap":{"unit":"px","size":12,"column":"12","row":"12","isLinked":true},"width":{"size":50,"unit":"%"},"flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"b95ec9c","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"How we choose","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":30},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"1b72bba","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>We look for three things. The piece has to be made in small numbers by people we can actually speak to. It has to age into something better rather than something tired. And it has to survive an Indian home, which means humidity, dust and being used every single day.</p><p>If a piece fails any of those, it does not go on the site, however good it photographs.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.7}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":false},{"id":"cf78138","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"full","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#000000","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"72","right":"64","bottom":"72","left":"64","isLinked":false},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":20,"column":"20","row":"20","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"62c276d","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Films are coming","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#FFFFFF","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":40},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.03}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"cc45be3","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>We are filming the first workshops now. When a film is ready it appears on the product it belongs to, and here. If you want to know when the first one lands, the monthly letter is the only place we announce it.</p>","text_color":"#B8B8BC","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":17},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.7}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false}]}
